abstract: >
  A fully reproducible verification framework for the World Bank Statistical
  Performance Indicators (SPI): an independent reconstruction of the full v4.0
  panel (1,613 country-year records, 188 economies, 2016-2024), a full-panel
  replication of the official missing-data (LOCF) rule, and a fully audited
  country-level implementation for Uzbekistan comprising 251 individually
  checked numerical claims. All figures are pinned to World Bank SPI release
  v4.0 (commit 2dd02f746cb4e2159281adc74d6865f948e90ce1).
